Subject: [PATCH 2/2] a6lte: document FM transport and add stock trace decoder

Record the manifest-derived source selection and stock evidence
for FM in the Broadcom Bluetooth stack, rather than a Si470x or
existing V4L2 backend. Document the remaining full integration work.

Add an offline H4 btsnoop filter for FM register/PCM commands,
responses and interrupts with framing and CLI tests. Retain raw
